flowchart TD
    box_0(["Start"])
    box_1["Store a representative sample of at least five<br/>damaged parts for quality assurance team inspection.<br/>Record the damage type, location, and the station at<br/>which damage was first observed."]
    box_2{"Are the damaged parts also found in the input<br/>product (i.e. damage present before entering the<br/>assembly line)?"}
    box_3["Continue with a different batch. Create a non<br/>conformance record for the defective input batch and<br/>notify the quality assurance team."]
    box_4{"Are there parts that have been pushed through the<br/>insert (over pressed parts)?"}
    box_5["Refer to the corrective action procedure<br/>introduction for examples of over pressed and<br/>correctly pressed parts to aid identification."]
    box_6[/"Refer to the corrective action procedure: over<br/>pressed part identification guide."/]
    box_7["Follow the over pressed part corrective procedure:<br/>halt the pressing station, inspect pressing head<br/>alignment and force limit, and quarantine the<br/>affected batch."]
    box_8{"Is the damage pattern consistent with marking<br/>induced thermal stress?"}
    box_9["Complete the following checks: 1. Read the current<br/>laser power level from the parameter screen. 2.<br/>Compare against the validated power setting on the<br/>process parameter sheet. 3. Check whether the power<br/>setting was modified since the last good run."]
    box_10{"Have the damaged parts been measured and approved at<br/>the metrology station?"}
    box_11["Measure the damaged parts on the metrology station.<br/>Record insertion depth, gap, and any surface<br/>deviation outside specification."]
    box_12{"Do the metrology station measurements confirm the<br/>parts are within the critical dimensional tolerance<br/>limits?"}
    box_13["Parts are within dimensional tolerance despite<br/>surface damage. Obtain approval from the quality<br/>assurance manager before releasing or quarantining<br/>the batch."]
    box_14["Block and quarantine the affected parts. Notify the<br/>maintenance team and quality assurance team with the<br/>metrology data."]
    box_15["Record all corrective actions taken, the batch<br/>number, and the final disposition of the affected<br/>parts in the quality log."]
    box_16{"Was production running during the fault period, are<br/>there additional parts to trace?"}
    box_17["Extract all part serial numbers produced during the<br/>fault window from the production tracking system<br/>traceability log."]
    box_18[/"Refer to the production tracking system traceability<br/>extraction procedure."/]
    box_19["Issue hold notice for all parts from the fault<br/>window pending quality assurance disposition review."]
    box_20{"Quality assurance team has acknowledged the hold<br/>notice and confirmed disposition plan?"}
    box_21(["End, Escalate: quality assurance disposition<br/>overdue, escalate to quality assurance manager"])
    box_22(["End, Hold confirmed. quality assurance disposition<br/>in progress. Procedure complete."])

